Declare and initialize a variable:

    type name = value;

Examples:

    int price = 100;
    double size = 10.5;
    char side = 'B';

Declare first, assign later:

    int quantity;
    quantity = 50;

Main idea:

    Always prefer initialization when creating a variable.

